    "summary": "Costs 1 CP. During your Shooting phase or either Fight phase, select one of your units using these keywords as alternatives: INQUISITOR, INQUISITORIAL AGENTS and ORDO MALLEUS. Find one enemy DAEMON no more than 12 inches away and visible to the selected unit. Test that enemy for Battle-shock. If it fails, attacks from your AGENTS OF THE IMPERIUM gain [DEVASTATING WOUNDS] against it for this phase.",
